<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Feb 27.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Feb 27.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Stockport Mar 114.00</p>
<p>London Mar 111.00/12.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk Mar 99.00/99.50 Apr/Jun 102.00</p>
<p>West Norfolk Apr/Jun 101.50</p>
<p>Yorkshire Apr/Jun 101.00 Jul 103.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Apr/Jun 103.00</p>
<p>Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northamptonshire and Ocfordshire Mar 106.50/07.00</p>
<p>Herefordshire Mar 107.00</p>
<p>Avon range Mar 108.00/08.50</p>
<p>Tilbury Mar 99.00/99.50 Apr/Jun 101.00</p>
<p>Feed barley Norfolk/Suffolk Mar 95.50 Apr/Jun 98.50</p>
<p>Southampton Mar 99.00</p>
<p>West Norfolk Mar 96.00</p>
</text>
